  "verdict_note": "TGAZ has no river layer (贛江 = 0 hits, 十八灘 = 0) but confirms the administrative units defining the Kan valley: 贛縣 under 贛州府 (hvd_841/hvd_40834) and 萬安縣 under 吉安府 (hvd_831). The 451.6 km to the river's Wikidata P625 point reflects the river's length, not a discrepancy.",
